test(63,'병합 날짜·숨김행·2개 시트 XLSX 생성 → 날짜 상속/숨김행/시트 전환 확인',async(p,c,check)=>{const b=await p.evaluate(({headers,D,E})=>{const w=XLSX.utils.book_new();const a=XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet([headers,['병합 첫 장소',D],['숨김 장소',''],['다음 날짜',E]]);a['!merges']=[{s:{r:1,c:1},e:{r:2,c:1}}];a['!rows']=[{},{},{hidden:true}];XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(w,a,'첫 시트');XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(w,XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet([headers,['다른 시트 장소',E]]),'둘째 시트');return Array.from(new Uint8Array(XLSX.write(w,{type:'array',bookType:'xlsx'})));},{headers,D,E});await file(p,Buffer.from(b));const current=await p.locator('#resultList .item-name').allTextContents();check('병합 날짜 상속 확인',/11\/1.*2곳/.test(await p.locator('#resultList .day-divider').first().textContent()),{names:current,body:await p.textContent('#resultList')});check('숨김행 처리 관찰',true,{hiddenRowImported:current.includes('숨김 장소'),policy:'현재 구현은 숨김행도 가져옴; 제외 정책/안내 없음'});await p.click('#columnsToggle');await p.selectOption('#sheetSelect','둘째 시트');check('선택한 시트만 표시',(await p.locator('#resultList .item-name').allTextContents()).join()==='다른 시트 장소',await p.locator('#resultList .item-name').allTextContents());});
test(64,'장소/날짜 동일 열 및 잘못된 열 매핑 → 미리보기 확인 후 수정',async(p,c,check)=>{await p.evaluate(()=>{document.querySelector('#columnsBody').classList.remove('hidden');document.querySelector('#columnsPanel').classList.remove('hidden');});await p.selectOption('#map-name','1');await p.selectOption('#map-date','1');const bad=await p.locator('#resultList .item-name').allTextContents();await p.selectOption('#map-name','0');const corrected=await p.locator('#resultList .item-name').allTextContents();check('매핑 결과 발견/수정 가능',bad[0]===D&&corrected[0]==='첫 장소',{bad,corrected,summary:await p.textContent('#columnsSummary')});});
test(65,'여행 엑셀 내보내기 파일 재업로드 → 이름·시간·메모·순서·좌표 비교',async(p,c,check)=>{await edit(p);await p.fill('#scheduleMemo','왕복 보존 메모');await p.click('#scheduleForm button[type=submit]');const before=await snap(p);const downloading=p.waitForEvent('download');await p.click('#exportXlsx');const d=await downloading;const target=path.join(OUT,'65-roundtrip.xlsx');await d.saveAs(target);await file(p,fs.readFileSync(target),'roundtrip.xlsx');const a=Object.values(await store(p)).find(t=>t.name==='roundtrip');check('행 순서/이름',JSON.stringify(names(a))===JSON.stringify(names(before)),names(a));check('시간/메모',a.records.every((r,i)=>(r.cells[2]?.v??'')===(before.records[i].cells[2]?.v??'')&&(r.cells[4]?.v??'')===(before.records[i].cells[4]?.v??'')),a.records.map(r=>[r.cells[2]?.v,r.cells[4]?.v]));check('좌표 왕복',a.records.every((r,i)=>r.cells[6]?.v===before.places[i].place.lat&&r.cells[7]?.v===before.places[i].place.lng),a.records.map(r=>[r.cells[6]?.v,r.cells[7]?.v]));});
test(66,'=,+,@,- 외부 문자열을 실제 엑셀/CSV 생성 함수에 전달 → 셀 타입·수식/CSV 구조 검사(수식 실행 없음)',async(p,c,check)=>{const data=await p.evaluate(async()=>{const ex=await import('/js/excel.js'),ed=await import('/js/xlsxedit.js');const values=['=1+1','+SUM(1,1)','@SUM(1,1)','-1+2'];const wb=ex.buildResultWorkbook({headers:['장소','메모'],mapping:{lat:-1,lng:-1},items:values.map(v=>({cells:[{v,t:'s'},{v,t:'s'}],status:'pending',place:null})),sheetName:'일정'});const arr=XLSX.write(wb,{type:'array',bookType:'xlsx'});const reread=XLSX.read(arr,{type:'array'});const result=ed.writeEditedWorkbook({buffer:new ArrayBuffer(0),fileName:'negative.csv',workbook:wb,sheetName:'일정',edits:[]});return {cells:values.map((v,i)=>reread.Sheets['일정']['A'+(i+2)]),csv:result.data,bytes:Array.from(new Uint8Array(arr))};});fs.writeFileSync(path.join(OUT,'66-formula.xlsx'),Buffer.from(data.bytes));fs.writeFileSync(path.join(OUT,'66-formula.csv'),data.csv);check('XLSX는 문자열, 수식 없음',data.cells.every(c=>c.t==='s'&&!c.f),data.cells);check('CSV 외부 수식 문자열 중화',!/(?:^|\n|,)[=+@-]/.test(data.csv),{csv:data.csv});});
test(67,'특수문자·HTML·위험 URL 포함 KML 생성 → DOMParser/위험 XML 요소 확인',async(p,c,check)=>{const out=await p.evaluate(async()=>{const {buildKml}=await import('/js/kml.js');const kml=buildKml({title:'<&테스트>',items:[{name:'<img src=x onerror="alert(1)">&',memo:'<script>bad()</script>',category:'2026-11-01',place:{lat:35,lng:139,address:'A&B'}}],colorOf:()=> '#123456',fieldsOf:()=>[['URL','javascript:alert(1)'],['HTML','<script>bad()</script>']]});const d=new DOMParser().parseFromString(kml,'text/xml');return{kml,parseErrors:d.querySelectorAll('parsererror').length,scriptNodes:d.querySelectorAll('script,img,a').length};});fs.writeFileSync(path.join(OUT,'67-malicious.kml'),out.kml);check('XML 유효/HTML 요소 비삽입',out.parseErrors===0&&out.scriptNodes===0,out);check('Google Earth 등 소비자의 description/URL 해석',null,'외부 KML 소비자 실행은 하지 않음');});
test(68,'모바일 레이아웃에서 Chromium 다운로드 deny → 실제 취소 상태와 저장 완료 문구 비교',async(p,c,check)=>{await p.setViewportSize({width:390,height:844});const target=await (await c.newCDPSession(p)).send('Target.getTargetInfo');const b=await browser.newBrowserCDPSession();await b.send('Browser.setDownloadBehavior',{behavior:'deny',browserContextId:target.targetInfo.browserContextId,eventsEnabled:true});await p.click('#mobileSave');const pending=p.waitForEvent('download');await p.click('#mobileExportXlsx');const d=await pending;const failure=await d.failure();check('브라우저 다운로드 차단 실제 확인',!!failure,{failure});check('차단 후 실제 저장 완료 오인 방지',!/저장했어요/.test(await p.textContent('#toast')),{toast:await p.textContent('#toast'),failure});});
